<title>USA: Trade estimates for USDA weekly grain export sales.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for USDA weekly grain export sales.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the U.S. Department of Agriculture's weekly net export sales were as follows (in tonnes). The report is slated for release at 0830 EST on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Commodity	  Estimate Range</p>
<p>    Corn	     700,000 to 900,000</p>
<p>    Wheat	    200,000 to 300,000</p>
<p>    Soybeans	 400,000 to 500,000</p>
<p>    Soyoil	    20,000 to 30,000</p>
<p>    Soymeal	   80,000 to 120,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
